:hasBlockState rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
               rdfs:domain :Block ;
               rdfs:range :BlockState .


###  http://rpcw.di.uminho.pt/2026/minecraft/hasEffect
:hasEffect rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
           rdfs:domain :Item ;
           rdfs:range :Effect .


###  http://rpcw.di.uminho.pt/2026/minecraft/hasIngredient
